n  Instance buttons of the HTML report.\n  \n  🌐 Prints the text digest and also writes a self-contained HTML report in\n  --output-dir, opened in the browser in an interactive terminal.\n  \n  🧪 With --sample, it analyzes the samples shipped in cfk-analysis/samples: a\n  quick way to see what it reports.\n  \n  🔖 Exit code is 0 when the analysis completed (whatever was found, read the\n  summary), 64 for an invalid, unsafe or empty bundle.\n  \n  🎬 Bite size session:\n  https://kafka-docker-playground.io/#/sessions?id=%%E2%%98%%B8%%EF%%B8%%8F-what-is-wrong-in-this-cfk-cluster\n\n"
